{
 "title": "Mexico",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Mexico",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c051",
     "shot": "mx_flag",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "1821, Mexico wins its independence from Spain,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c052",
     "shot": "mx_flag",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and California changes flags without a battle.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:changes",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c053",
     "shot": "mx_ranch",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Mexico closes the missions and hands out the land as giant ranches.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "c054",
     "shot": "mx_ranch",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The business is cattle.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "c055",
     "shot": "mx_ranch",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Cow hides were worth so much that sailors called them California banknotes.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "birds",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "kaching",
       "w:banknotes.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c056",
     "shot": "mx_trickle",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Then the Americans began to trickle in.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c057",
     "shot": "mx_trickle",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "First by ship, then in 1841 by wagon, straight over the mountains.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c058",
     "shot": "mx_sonoma",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And in June of 1846, about 30 of them marched into the little town of Sonoma,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c059",
     "shot": "mx_sonoma",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "arrested a Mexican general in his own house, and declared a brand new country.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c060",
     "shot": "mx_sonoma",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The California *Republic.*",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Republic.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c061",
     "shot": "mx_paint",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They needed a flag, so they painted a grizzly bear on a piece of cotton.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c062",
     "shot": "mx_paint",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "People said it looked more like a pig.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:pig.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c063",
     "shot": "mx_days",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The Republic lasted 25 days.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       0,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c064",
     "shot": "mx_days",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then the United States Navy arrived and said, thanks, we'll take it from here.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c065",
     "shot": "mx_grizzly",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "By the way, that bear is still on the state flag.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c066",
     "shot": "mx_grizzly",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And the California grizzly? Extinct.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:Extinct.",
       0.7
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c067",
     "shot": "mx_grizzly",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The last one was shot in 1922.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c068",
     "shot": "mx_dates",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Now watch the dates, because this is the worst timing in history.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c069",
     "shot": "mx_cession",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "February 2nd, 1848, Mexico signs a treaty and hands California to the United States.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c070",
     "shot": "mx_nine",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Nine days earlier, on a river in the California hills,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:Nine",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c071",
     "shot": "mx_nine",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a carpenter had looked down into the water.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}